---
import ProductCrop from './ProductCrop.astro';

---
<section class="record-section wrap" id="record">
<div class="record-copy">
<p class="eyebrow">01 / RECORD EVERY CATCH</p>
<h2>A photo is optional.<br>
<em>The memory isn’t.</em>
</h2>
<p>Add a catch yourself, with or without a photo. Keep the details you want to remember.</p>
<dl class="field-list">
<div>
<dt>The fish</dt>
<dd>Species &amp; weight</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>The moment</dt>
<dd>Date, time &amp; location</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>The details</dt>
<dd>Method, bait, lure or fly</dd>
</div>
</dl>
</div>
<figure class="entry-proof">
<span class="figure-heading">Three ways to begin</span>
<ProductCrop name="home-1.2.12.png" box="38 232 705 458" width={780} height={1688} alt="Actual CatchID Home screen crop showing Take a photo, Choose a photo and Add without a photo." class="" />
<figcaption>Actual app entry controls · existing approved capture</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
